            "title": "Introduction",
            "id": 86509,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi memerlukan <strong>beberapa parameter</strong> untuk menjalankan tugas pada lebih banyak bagian data, seperti nama depan dan nama belakang pemain baru.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #F0F8FF&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    padding: 10px;&#xA;    margin: 10px;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #playerList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Add Team Players&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;Signup&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;playerInput&quot;&gt; &#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;firstNameInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;First Name&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;surnameInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Last Name&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt; &#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Current Team&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=playerList&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let number = 0;&#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    if (number &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Team Full&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const firstName = document.getElementById(&quot;firstNameInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     const surname = document.getElementById(&quot;surnameInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     const node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     const textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Added: &quot; + firstName +&#xA;      &quot; &quot; + surname);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;playerList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     number++;&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;firstNameInput&quot;).value = &quot;&quot;;&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;surnameInput&quot;).value = &quot;&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Previously",
            "id": 86514,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa membuat fungsi dengan satu parameter seperti <code>display(first_name)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first_name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first_name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>display</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>first_name</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi header fungsi dan pernyataan tampilan agar pemanggilan mencetak <code>Alex</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first_name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first_name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"first\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"last_name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>display</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>first_name</code>, <code>)</code>, dan terakhir <code>print</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Comma",
            "id": 86511,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menambahkan lebih banyak parameter ke fungsi, tulis <strong>koma</strong> diikuti nama parameter berikutnya, seperti <code>last</code> untuk nama belakang.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menambahkan parameter lain, tulis koma diikuti namanya.</p><p>Tambahkan parameter untuk nama belakang agar pemanggilan mencetak <code>Alex Morgan</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"first\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "More values",
            "id": 86535,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk meneruskan nilai kedua ke fungsi, seperti nama belakang <code>\"Morgan\"</code>, tulis koma diikuti nilainya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Morgan\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk meneruskan nilai lain dalam pemanggilan fungsi, tulis koma diikuti nilai tersebut.</p><p>Lengkapi pemanggilan agar kode mencetak <code>Alex Morgan</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Morgan\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 86510,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah menambahkan parameter baru dan meneruskan nilai yang sesuai, kita bisa menggunakannya di dalam fungsi, seperti di sini dengan <code>last</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>, diikuti oleh <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah menambahkan parameter baru dan meneruskan nilai yang sesuai, kita dapat memakainya di dalam fungsi, seperti <code>last</code> di sini.</p><p>Gunakan kedua parameter untuk mencetak <code>Alex Morgan</code> dengan spasi di antara kedua nama.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;first&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;last&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>first</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\" \"</code>, dan terakhir <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Order",
            "id": 86512,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita meneruskan nilai ke fungsi sesuai urutan parameter, seperti di sini dengan <code>\"Alex\"</code> untuk <code>first</code>, dan <code>\"Morgan\"</code> untuk <code>last</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Alex\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Morgan\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai mengisi parameter secara berurutan. Teruskan kedua nama agar kode menampilkan <code>Alex Morgan</code> dalam urutan itu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexander&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Alex\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Morgan\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple parameters",
            "id": 86513,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menambahkan sebanyak mungkin parameter yang kita inginkan, asalkan kita memisahkannya dengan koma, seperti di sini dengan <code>third</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;First place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Second place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Third place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First place: Kim\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second place: Lee\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third place: Ava\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu dapat menambahkan sebanyak mungkin parameter yang diperlukan dengan memisahkannya menggunakan koma.</p><p>Tambahkan parameter ketiga agar baris terakhir mencetak <code>Third place: Ava</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;First place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Second place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Third place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"second\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First place: Kim\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second place: Lee\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third place: Ava\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Comma",
            "id": 86519,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tanda apa yang memisahkan parameter fungsi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi memerlukan parameter <code>first</code> dan <code>second</code>. Header mana yang memisahkannya dengan benar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>def show(first, second):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>def show(first; second):</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>def show(first second):</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>def show(first, second):</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters",
            "id": 86520,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa banyak parameter yang dapat dimiliki sebuah fungsi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebanyak yang kita inginkan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Maksimal tiga</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebanyak yang kita inginkan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi sudah memiliki tiga parameter, tetapi kini memerlukan nilai keempat. Apa yang dapat kamu lakukan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tambahkan parameter keempat ke definisi.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tetap gunakan tiga karena Python hanya mengizinkan maksimal tiga parameter.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ganti parameter yang ada karena jumlahnya tidak dapat bertambah.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tambahkan parameter keempat ke definisi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Order",
            "id": 86521,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat memanggil fungsi, bagaimana cara kita meneruskan nilai ke fungsi tersebut ketika fungsi memiliki beberapa parameter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sesuai urutan parameter ditempatkan dalam definisi fungsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dalam urutan apa pun</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sesuai urutan parameter ditempatkan dalam definisi fungsi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk <code>def label(city, country):</code>, bagaimana <code>label(\"Paris\", \"France\")</code> menetapkan nilainya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>city</code> menerima <code>\"Paris\"</code> dan <code>country</code> menerima <code>\"France\"</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>city</code> menerima <code>\"France\"</code> dan <code>country</code> menerima <code>\"Paris\"</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kedua parameter menerima <code>\"Paris\"</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>city</code> menerima <code>\"Paris\"</code> dan <code>country</code> menerima <code>\"France\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Order 2",
            "id": 86525,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai mana yang ditampilkan terakhir di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1st: Helen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joe</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Helen</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Joe</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa <code>Joe</code> muncul pada baris output kedua?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1st: Helen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Argumen kedua menjadi <code>second</code>, yang digunakan oleh <code>print()</code> kedua.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python menampilkan argumen fungsi dalam urutan alfabetis.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Argumen kedua menggantikan nilai <code>first</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Argumen kedua menjadi <code>second</code>, yang digunakan oleh <code>print()</code> kedua.</p></body></html>"
          },
