            "title": "Question: Multiple parameters",
            "id": 86547,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"combine\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"result = combine(\" /><text value=\"&quot;big&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;wolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"bigbadwolf\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bigbadwolf</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>wolfbadbig</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>bigbadwolf</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsol di bawah ini menampilkan <code>bigbadwolf</code>. Pemanggilan mana yang akan membuat <code>print(result)</code> menampilkan <code>wolfbadbig</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"combine\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"result = combine(\" /><text value=\"&quot;big&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;wolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"bigbadwolf\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>combine(\"wolf\", \"bad\", \"big\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>combine(\"big\", \"bad\", \"wolf\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>combine(\"bad\", \"wolf\", \"big\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>combine(\"wolf\", \"bad\", \"big\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 86515,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan parameter kedua ke fungsi ini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"create_email\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, year)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name + year + \" /><text value=\"&quot;@hutmail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"email = create_email(\" /><text value=\"&quot;jo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(email)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"jo1998@hutmail.com\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>year</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Beri fungsi ini dua parameter agar dapat membuat email dan menampilkan <code>jo1998@hutmail.com</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"create_email\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, year)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name + year + \" /><text value=\"&quot;@hutmail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"email = create_email(\" /><text value=\"&quot;jo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(email)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;jo&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1998&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"jo1998@hutmail.com\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>name</code>, diikuti oleh <code>year</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comma",
            "id": 86516,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodekan koma <code>,</code> untuk memisahkan kedua parameter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_prefix\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(prefix, word)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prefix + word\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"new_word = add_prefix(\" /><text value=\"&quot;re&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;do&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(new_word)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"redo\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
